readme.text:
New-Item -ItemType Junction `
  -Path "$env:USERPROFILE\.dsh\profiles\desktop\node_modules\dsh-ai-with-u" `
  -Target "<你的克隆路径>"
```

然后编辑 `~/.dsh/profiles/desktop/package.json`：

```jsonc
{
  "dependencies": {
    "dsh-ai-with-u": "link:<你的克隆路径>"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "profile": {
      "bundles": [
        // ...
        "dsh-ai-with-u"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

最后重启 DSH。宿主不会热加载 `lib/index.js`。
